dialogs
0	TEAM AQUA's been training their WAILMER in the cove.We SAILORS can't get our boats out to sea with them in the way!
1	Have you seen that strange cave in the cove at the edge of town?
2	There's a POKéMON CONTEST HALL right in this here town.That means well-raised POKéMON will come from all over the country.My heart swells with excitement!
3	I came from KANTO.The HOENN region is beautiful with all its water and verdant nature.Hunh? Wait a second…Could there be rare POKéMON that live only in this area?
4	I'm an ART DEALER.I am a buyer and seller of fine art, especially paintings.I've heard that the MUSEUM here has magnificent works on exhibit…
5	I was taking a relaxing snooze at the seaside inn to the sound of waves…When someone stole my POKéMON!Who's the abductor? TEAM AQUA? Is it TEAM AQUA?
6	Even as we grow old and wrinkled, the sea remains forever young with the vivid brilliance of life…Fwohoho fwohohohoho…
7	It was sixty years ago that my husband proposed to me here. The sea remains as beautiful as ever.Mufufufu mufufufufufu…
8	Hm, you know of the peculiar cavern in this cove?That had been a natural formation, but then that TEAM AQUA lot came along and made their renovations.They call themselves the “nature-loving TEAM AQUA”!But what they do and what they say don't match at all!
9	There! WAILMER! Leap out of the water now!
11	If this whole wide world becomes ours, TEAM AQUA's, it will be a happier place for POKéMON, too.
12	Fufufu…We moved more loot into our secret HIDEOUT today…Wh-who are you?! I was just talking to myself!
13	I'm just a GRUNT, so I don't know what the BOSS is thinking…But being on TEAM AQUA, I know I'll get the chance to do big things!Wh-who are you?! I was just talking to myself!
14	Hey, you!Don't go near the cave in the cove!Why? You don't need a reason why! I'm an adult, so you just listen to me!
17	Do you know about the machine BERRY BLENDER?
18	On our honeymoon, we vowed to see as many rare POKéMON as we can.So we were delighted to see a rare POKéMON as soon as we arrived.I mean, we are totally happy!
19	We just arrived here on our honeymoon vacation.We happened to see a DRAGON-type POKéMON flying way up in the sky.Do cool POKéMON like that live in the HOENN region?
20	I heard there's a tower somewhere out on the sea routes.It's called the SKY PILLAR, I hear.
21	I saw this tall tower somewhere around ROUTE 131.Could that possibly be…?
