release
end
= LilycoveCity_EventScript_ExpertM2AquaGone
msgbox	That cave in the cove…I didn't notice it right away, but it's completely empty now.That TEAM AQUA lot, they must have gone away for good.
release
end
= LilycoveCity_EventScript_ExpertF
msgbox	It was sixty years ago that my husband proposed to me here. The sea remains as beautiful as ever.Mufufufu mufufufufufu…
end
= LilycoveCity_EventScript_ExpertM1
